    <div class="rec"><p class="q">"He leads with solutions. Where others see roadblocks, Aneil sees the next move. He takes ambiguous problems, rallies the people around him, and drives toward outcomes that actually matter to the end user."</p><div class="who"><img class="av" src="assets/work/testimonial-michael.jpg" alt="Michael Grigone"><div><div class="nm"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-grigone-696a8a197/" target="_blank">Michael Grigone</a></div><div class="rl">Account Executive, SPOTIO</div></div></div></div>
